# E-Biker: rider in a teal Lycra top (t/T, w stripe) over Lederhosen (O/l),
# silver helmet (w/i/m), white socks; blue e-bike (S/b) with the battery
# pack on the down tube (m/d with y charge LEDs), brass bell Y/o and
# headlight Y/o on the trekking bar. Faces LEFT; no mirror (like the Fiaker).
# idle = parked, one foot down. telegraph = front wheel lifted 2 px, bell
# glint + ring marks and headlight beam blinking (frame 0 on, frame 1 off).
# ride = spokes and pedals alternate. crash = bike flat on the ground, rider
# sitting dazed with stars and a little dust cloud. squished = rider
# squashed flat on the ground beside the parked bike.
# Built with a scratch script (lines + parts + automatic k outline), then
# frozen to text here.
sprite = e_biker
size   = 32x24
origin = 16,24
hitbox = 3,4,26,20
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = ride      frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = crash     frames=1
anim   = squished  frames=1
